(doc
  (title "Python Implementation Build Steps")
  (source-format markdown)
  (converted "2026-07-19")
  (para "Build steps for creating the YX protocol Python implementation.")
  (section
    (heading "Overview")
    (para "These steps guide the AI agent through building a complete Python implementation of the YX protocol, including:")
    (item "Core protocol (packet building, parsing, HMAC)")
    (item "Transport layer (UDP, asyncio)")
    (item "Protocol handlers (Text Protocol 0, Binary Protocol 1)")
    (item "Security (HMAC-SHA256, AES-256-GCM, ZLIB compression)")
    (item "Comprehensive tests")
    (item "Canonical artifact generation"))
  (section
    (heading "Step Sequence")
    (para "Steps will be created in order:")
    (item "1. **Project Setup** - Create Python project structure, pyproject.toml")
    (item "2. **Packet Core** - Packet dataclass, GUIDFactory")
    (item "3. **Packet Builder** - Build, parse, validate packets")
    (item "4. **HMAC Security** - HMAC-SHA256 computation and validation")
    (item "5. **Encryption** - AES-256-GCM encryption/decryption")
    (item "6. **Compression** - ZLIB compression/decompression")
    (item "7. **UDP Transport** - Socket handling, asyncio integration")
    (item "8. **Text Protocol** - Protocol 0 handler")
    (item "9. **Binary Protocol** - Protocol 1 handler (v2.0 with channels)")
    (item "10. **Protocol Router** - Route packets to correct handler")
    (item "11. **Security Components** - RateLimiter, ReplayProtection, KeyStore")
    (item "12. **Unit Tests** - Test all components")
    (item "13. **Integration Tests** - End-to-end flows")
    (item "14. **Network Tests** - UDP broadcast, SO_REUSEPORT")
    (item "15. **Canonical Artifacts** - Generate test vectors for other implementations")
    (item "16. **Documentation** - README, API docs")
    (item "17. **Final Verification** - All tests pass, coverage ≥80%"))
  (section
    (heading "Target Build Directory")
    (para "`../../builds/python-impl/`"))
  (section
    (heading "Traceability")
    (para "All steps implement specifications from:")
    (item "`../../protocol/specs/technical/yx-protocol-spec.sxp` - Protocol specification")
    (item "`../../protocol/specs/testing/testing-strategy.sxp` - Testing requirements")
    (item "`../../protocol/specs/architecture/implementation-languages.sxp` - Language guidance"))
  (section
    (heading "Canonical Artifact Generation")
    (para "**Critical Step:** Python implementation generates canonical test vectors")
    (para "Output to: `../../canonical/test-vectors/`")
    (para "These artifacts enable other language implementations to validate wire format compatibility."))
  (section
    (heading "Current Status")
    (para "Steps not yet created. Will be added as part of YBS system development.")))
